# Disabled legacy GitHub Pages workflow
#
# This file intentionally replaces the previous `static.yml` deployment workflow.
# The legacy workflow uploaded the entire repository root (`path: '.'`) to GitHub Pages,
# while the canonical Sentinel-6 public site lives under `site/`.
#
# Canonical deployment workflow:
#   .github/workflows/pages.yml
# Canonical publish path:
#   ./site
#
# Do not re-enable a second Pages deploy workflow. Multiple workflows targeting the same
# `github-pages` environment can overwrite one another and can produce a root 404 when
# the repository root does not contain the intended `index.html`.
#
# Follow-up UI rebuild is tracked separately under the Creator Construction 3D UI/UX mandate.
